    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luminis: Heal Them All</strong> is a small-scale open world survival shooter \u2014 with a twist. Set in a futuristic world set alert by a strange virus, your goal isn\u2019t to destroy the infected, but to <strong>heal them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget bullets that kill. In Luminis, every firearm is a healing device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Heal the Sick</strong></u><br>A mutating virus is wreaking havoc on wildlife. Meanwhile, a rogue faction from the tech city of Ullis is hacking robots across the region, unleashing chaos to further their own agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a volunteer healer, you\u2019ve left your old life behind to explore, survive, and cure whatever you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re humanity\u2019s best hope \u2014 and their first gentle hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>'Combat'</u></strong><u>\u00a0<strong>- with a twist</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you shoot things \u2014 but not to kill. <br>You\u2019ll wield therapeutic rifles, pistols, shotguns, and snipers, all designed to calm and cure. Heal, and enemies will stop attacking \u2014 some may even become your best allies. Combat is tense, tactical, and driven by compassion, not violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the open world for loot and lost tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From food and crafting materials to powerful healing gear, survival depends on how well you adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild is harsh \u2014 but every life you save makes it better.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luminis: Heal Them All</strong> is a small-scale open world survival shooter \u2014 with a twist. Set in a futuristic world set alert by a strange virus, your goal isn\u2019t to destroy the infected, but to <strong>heal them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget bullets that kill. In Luminis, every firearm is a healing device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Heal the Sick</strong></u><br>A mutating virus is wreaking havoc on wildlife. Meanwhile, a rogue faction from the tech city of Ullis is hacking robots across the region, unleashing chaos to further their own agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a volunteer healer, you\u2019ve left your old life behind to explore, survive, and cure whatever you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re humanity\u2019s best hope \u2014 and their first gentle hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/bd2bfab1ae0ebfc1ea9addaf3536a115.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>'Combat'</u></strong><u>\u00a0<strong>- with a twist</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you shoot things \u2014 but not to kill. <br>You\u2019ll wield therapeutic rifles, pistols, shotguns, and snipers, all designed to calm and cure. Heal, and enemies will stop attacking \u2014 some may even become your best allies. Combat is tense, tactical, and driven by compassion, not violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/5509c2bacee86393321eec886853d221.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the open world for loot and lost tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From food and crafting materials to powerful healing gear, survival depends on how well you adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild is harsh \u2014 but every life you save makes it better.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.poster.avif?t=1754916739\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.webm?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.mp4?t=1754916739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
